254
00:18:37,610 --> 00:18:40,950
And if having the perfect wedding makes you happy...

255
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:43,320
...then that's what we're gonna do.

256
00:18:43,700 --> 00:18:46,120
You are so sweet.

257
00:18:48,250 --> 00:18:50,080
Oh, but wait.

258
00:18:50,580 --> 00:18:53,210
What about our...? What about the future and stuff?

259
00:18:53,380 --> 00:18:55,710
